# edge_cases

Native bindings for edge_cases

Node.js bindings for the `edge_cases` native library: an ES module over a small N-API addon (`edge_cases_node.c`) that `npm install` compiles with node-gyp. The addon links `edge_cases`; set `EDGE_CASES_LIBRARY` to the library file (or its directory) when installing, or pass `--edge_cases-library=<path>` to npm.

```sh
EDGE_CASES_LIBRARY=/path/to/libedge_cases.so npm install edge_cases
```

Each top-level module of the API is a namespace export:

```js
import { edge_cases } from 'edge_cases';
```

<!-- END README.md -->
